title: Civil War
audio: music/communist/A_las_barricadas.ogg
on-arrival: decree_decided = 0; chancellorship_decided = 0; government_decided = 0; constitution_decided = 0; communists_decided = 0; reichstag_decided = 0; {!
Q.rb_strength = Math.round(Q.rb_strength);
Q.sh_strength = Math.round(Q.sh_strength);
Q.sa_strength = Math.round(Q.sa_strength);
// re-calculate dissent, in case we transitioned from, say, the KPD support that raised reformist dissent.
var total_strength = Q.left_strength + Q.center_strength + Q.labor_strength + Q.reformist_strength + Q.neorevisionist_strength;
var total_dissent = Q.left_strength*Q.left_dissent + Q.center_strength*Q.center_dissent + Q.labor_strength*Q.labor_dissent + Q.reformist_strength*Q.reformist_dissent + Q.neorevisionist_strength*Q.neorevisionist_dissent;

Q.dissent = 0.01*total_dissent/total_strength;
console.log('new dissent: ' + Q.dissent);

if (Q.dissent < 0) {
    Q.dissent = 0;
} else if (Q.dissent > 0.95) {
    Q.dissent = 0.95;
}

Q.civil_war_seen = 1;

// our allies
Q.total_power = 0;
// TODO:  lower reichsbanner strength if the party's popularity is very low.
Q.rb_power = Q.rb_strength*Q.rb_militancy;
if (Q.dissent > 0.15) {
    Q.rb_power *= (1 - Q.dissent/1.5);
}
if (Q.spd_normalized < 0.25) {
    Q.rb_power *= (Q.spd_normalized/0.25);
}
Q.total_power += Q.rb_power;
Q.prussian_police_power = Q.prussian_police_strength*Q.prussian_police_militancy*Q.prussian_police_loyalty;
if (Q.spd_prussia) {
    Q.total_power += Q.prussian_police_power;
}
if (Q.reichswehr_loyalty < 0) {
    Q.reichswehr_loyalty = 0;
}
Q.loyal_reichswehr_power = Q.reichswehr_strength*Q.reichswehr_militancy*Q.reichswehr_loyalty;
if (Q.spd_in_government && Q.chancellor_party == "SPD") {
    Q.total_power += Q.loyal_reichswehr_power;
} else {
    Q.total_power += Q.loyal_reichswehr_power/4;
}
Q.rfb_power = Q.rfb_strength*Q.rfb_militancy;
if (Q.kpd_relation >= 60) {
    Q.total_power += Q.rfb_power;
} else if (Q.kpd_relation >= 45) {
    Q.total_power += Q.rfb_power*0.5;
}
// general strike strength
// maximum (given 25 labor strength) is 400
// use normalized workers_spd instead of labor_strength?
Q.normalized_workers_total = Q.workers_spd_normalized;
if (Q.kpd_relation >= 60) {
    Q.normalized_workers_total += Q.workers_kpd_normalized;
} else if (Q.kpd_relation >= 45) {
    Q.normalized_workers_total += Q.workers_kpd_normalized*0.5;
}
if (Q.sapd_formed) {
    Q.normalized_workers_total += Q.workers_sapd_normalized;
}
Q.total_power += (2 - Q.labor_dissent/100)*Q.normalized_workers_total*(2 - Q.unemployed/100)*2.5;
console.log("Supporter strength:", Q.total_power);

// our enemies
Q.enemy_power = 0;
Q.sa_power = Q.sa_strength*Q.sa_militancy;
Q.enemy_power += Q.sa_power;
Q.sh_power = Q.sh_strength*Q.sh_militancy;
Q.enemy_power += Q.sh_power;
Q.hostile_reichswehr_power = Q.reichswehr_strength*Q.reichswehr_militancy*(1-Q.reichswehr_loyalty);
Q.enemy_power += Q.hostile_reichswehr_power;
if (Q.harzburg_purged == 1) {
    Q.enemy_power *= 0.8;
}
if (Q.anschluss_attempt) {
    Q.enemy_power += (Q.austria_strength*Q.austria_militancy);
}
console.log("Enemy strength:", Q.enemy_power);

if (Q.total_power > Q.enemy_power*1.1) {
    Q.republic_victory = 1;
} else if (Q.total_power/Q.enemy_power >= 0.6) {
    Q.long_war = 1;
} else {
    Q.total_defeat = 1;
}

Q.is_favorable = 0;
if (Q.total_power >= Q.enemy_power*0.95) {
    Q.is_favorable = 1;
}
!}
go-to: war_menu

= 力量对比

我们的敌人是民族主义的钢盔团,兵力 [+ sh_strength +] 千人;以及纳粹冲锋队,兵力 [+ sa_strength +] 千人。国防军([+ reichswehr_strength +] 千名正规军)与普鲁士警察([+ prussian_police_strength +] 千人)的忠诚尚不明朗。

[? if chancellor_party == "KPD" or president == "Thälmann" : 共产党的准军事组织 RFB 正主导着这场战斗,而我们是他们的同袍。 ?]

我们这边有国旗团,成员 [+ rb_strength +] 千人。 [? if dissent > 0.15 and dissent <= 0.25: 它因党内异议而有所削弱,一些成员选择不参战。 ?][? if dissent > 0.25 and dissent < 0.5: 它因党内异议而削弱,许多成员选择不参战。 ?][? if dissent >= 0.5: 它因党内异议而严重削弱,相当一部分成员选择不参战。 ?]

[? if rb_militancy < 0.25 : 遗憾的是,国旗团训练与装备都很差,无法抵挡军事化程度更高的对手。 ?][? if rb_militancy >= 0.25 and rb_militancy < 0.5 : 我们已投入一些资源训练、装备国旗团。但愿我们的人能坚持住。 ?][? if rb_militancy >= 0.5 : 我们花了相当多的资源把国旗团打造成一支战斗力量。但愿他们能活下来。 ?]

我们还有什么?

# note: many scenarios lead to civil war. This calculates the array of forces, and the possible outcomes.

@war_menu

- @rw_help: Appeal to the Reichswehr to stand down.
- @kpd_help: Call for support from the Communists.
- @general_strike: Call a general strike!
- @loyal_police: Call up the loyal portions of the police.
- @war_outcome: Now, the battle...

@rw_help
max-visits: 1
go-to: war_menu
on-arrival: war_choices += 1

我们已呼吁国防军保持克制,避免杀害自己的同胞。 [? if reichswehr_loyalty < 0.2 : 遗憾的是,响应我们呼吁的人寥寥无几;国防军憎恶我们。 ?][? if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.2 and reichswehr_loyalty < 0.4 : 一些军官与士兵响应我们不要与我们为敌的呼吁。有些人甚至加入我们。 ?][? if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.4 and reichswehr_loyalty < 0.6 : 国防军发生分裂。许多人避免选边站,或者站到我们这边。 ?][? if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.6 : 出人意料,国防军的多数站在我们这边!我们的准备奏效了。 ?]

@kpd_help
max-visits: 1
view-if: chancellor_party != "KPD" and president != "Thälmann" 
go-to: war_menu
on-arrival: war_choices += 1

除支持共产党的工人之外,共产党的 RFB 还有 [+ rfb_strength +] 千名战士。

[? if kpd_relation >= 60 : 由于我们关系良好,共产党完全站在我们这边。 ?][? if kpd_relation < 60 and kpd_relation >= 45 : 由于与我们关系良好,共产党多数站在我们这边。 ?][? if kpd_relation < 45 : 共产党不支持我们。 ?]

@general_strike
max-visits: 1
go-to: war_menu
on-arrival: war_choices += 1

1920 年一场总罢工阻止了卡普政变,今天它同样能阻止法西斯主义。 [? if normalized_workers_total > 70 : 工人大体上与我们团结一致。 ?][? if normalized_workers_total >= 50 and normalized_workers_total <= 70 : 劳工内部有些异议,但多数工人支持总罢工。 ?][? if normalized_workers_total > 30 and normalized_workers_total < 50 : 然而,劳工内部异议不少,支持总罢工的不到半数。 ?][? if normalized_workers_total <= 30 : 然而,劳工内部严重分裂,多数工人不响应罢工号召。 ?]


@loyal_police
max-visits: 1
go-to: war_menu
on-arrival: war_choices += 1
view-if: spd_prussia = 1

由于我们仍掌控着普鲁士政府,我们可以调用普鲁士警察。 [? if prussian_police_loyalty < 0.4 : 遗憾的是,警察在政治上充其量是不可靠的。 ?][? if prussian_police_loyalty >= 0.4 and prussian_police_loyalty < 0.65 : 在这关键的时刻,普鲁士警察发生分裂,约有一半积极支持我们的行动。 ?][? if prussian_police_loyalty >= 0.65 : 多数人加入支持我们的行动。我们培养警察共和派忠诚的努力证明了其价值。 ?]




@foreign_intervention
max-visits: 1
go-to: war_menu
on-arrival: war_choices += 1; 

# note: the Prussian coup should not trigger foreign intervention...


@war_outcome
view-if: war_choices >= 2
go-to: defeat if total_defeat = 1; long_war if long_war = 1; republic_victory if republic_victory = 1

@defeat

= 彻底失败

我们的力量根本不是反动派的对手。国旗团的战士很快就被钢盔团、冲锋队与国防军的力量压倒。许多人在其余人投降之前便已丧命。随着反动派攫取对德国的绝对权力,我们余下的领袖或逃亡国外,或被处决。

我们的抵抗将被载入史册;将来,我们的名字将受人敬仰。但眼下,一切已成泡影。

- @game_over: Game over.

@long_war
go-to: long_war_intervention if resist_coup == 0; game_over_menu if resist_coup == 1

= 长期战争

行动的第一阶段结束,而不知怎的,双方都还屹立不倒。

战争陷入固定的战线。这不会是场速决的政变,而是一场长期内战。这个民族将在得以重建之前先自我毁灭。

@game_over_menu

尽管我们或许想请求外国援助,但列强把这场「普鲁士政变」视为纯粹的内部事务。

- @game_over

# no war

@long_war_intervention

- @west_aid: Perhaps we can receive aid from the Western powers, France and Britain.
- @soviet_aid: Perhaps we can receive aid from the Soviet Union.
- @east_aid: Perhaps our eastern neighbors, Poland and Czechoslovakia, can help us. If they know anything, they do not want fascists coming to power in Germany.
- @austria_aid: Perhaps the SDAPÖ can help us in our fight?
- @game_over: Game over.

@west_aid
choose-if: west_relation >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: 我们的关系还不够牢固。
on-arrival: west_aid += 1
max-visits: 1
go-to: long_war_intervention

我们向西方发出求援呼吁,但他们的政府在是否支持我们上意见分歧。在他们作出决定之前,我们只能靠自己活下去。

@soviet_aid
choose-if: (soviet_relation >= 1 and kpd_relation >= 50) or (kpd_relation >= 75)
on-arrival: soviet_aid += 1
unavailable-subtitle: 我们的关系还不够牢固。
max-visits: 1
go-to: long_war_intervention

我们向苏联发出求援呼吁。大部分援助落到了共产党手中,而国旗团与我们忠诚的军队则陷入困境。若我们获胜,这对我们的未来可不是好兆头。

@east_aid
choose-if: east_relation >= 2
on-arrival: east_aid += 1
unavailable-subtitle: 我们的关系还不够牢固。
max-visits: 1
go-to: long_war_intervention

波兰与捷克斯洛伐克大体上自顾不暇,帮不上太多忙,但武器与志愿人员经由我们控制的那些边境地段渗入进来。

@austria_aid
view-if: austria_victory
on-arrival: austria_aid += 1
max-visits: 1
go-to: long_war_intervention

奥地利社会民主党仍忙于重建奥地利、抵御奥地利法西斯分子与纳粹的双重袭扰,但他们没有忘记我们曾如何帮助他们推翻陶尔斐斯。他们能腾出的人手越过边境,带来急需的补给,以及对抗法西斯主义的经验。

@republic_victory
on-arrival: hitler_dead = 1 if anschluss_attempt; nazi_austria = 0 if anschluss_attempt; sa_ban_timer = 16; sh_ban_timer = 16; nsdap_banned = 1; dne_banned = 1 if dne_formed; dne_reorganized = 0 if dne_reorganized; party_bans = 1; sa_banned = 1; sh_banned = 1; constitutional_reform += 1; rfb_banned = 0 if kpd_relation >= 60; kpd_ally = 1 if kpd_relation >= 60; pro_republic += 25; unemployed_spd += 10*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 6*(1-dissent); chancellor = "N/A" if chancellor = "Hitler"; chancellor_party = "I" if chancellor_party = "NSDAP"; victory_republic = 1; unemployed_nsdap *= 0.4; new_middle_nsdap *= 0.5; old_middle_nsdap *= 0.6; workers_nsdap *= 0.5; rural_nsdap *= 0.7; old_middle_dnvp *= 0.6; rural_dnvp *= 0.7; new_middle_dnvp *= 0.6; old_middle_dvp += 5; new_middle_dvp += 5; sa_strength *= 0.2; sh_strength *= 0.2; sa_militancy *= 0.5; sh_militancy *= 0.5; rb_strength *= 0.8; rfb_strength *= 0.8; reichswehr_strength *= reichswehr_loyalty; reichswehr_loyalty += 0.2; socialism += 5; socialism += 5 if kpd_relation >= 60; {!
// monopoly on violence
Q.sa_force = Q.sa_strength*Q.sa_militancy;
Q.sh_force = Q.sh_strength*Q.sh_militancy;
Q.rb_force = Q.rb_strength*Q.rb_militancy;
Q.rfb_force = Q.rfb_strength*Q.rfb_militancy;
Q.army_force = Q.reichswehr_strength*Q.reichswehr_militancy;
Q.prussia_force = Q.prussian_police_strength*Q.prussian_police_militancy;
var total_force = (Q.sa_force+Q.sh_force+Q.rb_force+Q.rfb_force+Q.army_force+Q.prussia_force);

Q.sa_force = Math.round((Q.sa_force/total_force)*100);
Q.sh_force = Math.round((Q.sh_force/total_force)*100);
Q.rb_force = Math.round((Q.rb_force/total_force)*100);
Q.rfb_force = Math.round((Q.rfb_force/total_force)*100);
Q.army_force = Math.round((Q.army_force/total_force)*100);
Q.prussia_force = Math.round((Q.prussia_force/total_force)*100);
!}

= 共和国的胜利

战线守住了,冲锋队、钢盔团与支持政变的国防军力量被击败。今天,共和国的力量战胜了法西斯分子与反动派。德国出现了一场新的革命。但愿它带来的和平比上一场更为持久。

[? if anschluss_attempt : 纳粹在奥地利已然崩溃,该国陷入一场同时爆发的内战,至今仍在激烈进行。我们听说希特勒已经殒命。 ?]

- @agenda_gov: We must decide our new agenda.
- @agenda_reb: We must decide our new agenda.
- @agenda_kpd: We must decide our new agenda.

@agenda_gov
view-if: nazi_rebel = 1 and president != "Thälmann"

反动派的失败给了我们一个独特的机会。我们有多项议题需要处理。

- @hindenburg: The presidency.
- @government: The government.

@hindenburg
view-if: president == "Hindenburg" and not presidency_decided
on-arrival: presidency_decided = 1
subtitle: We may force Hindenburg to resign.

现任总统兴登堡无疑 —— 至少通过其懈怠 —— 助长了反动势力的壮大与得势。既然这些反动势力已被击败,我们或许可以迫使他辞职。不过,也有人警告不要搅动局势。

- @keep: Let Hindenburg stay President.
- @resign: Demand Hindenburg's resignation.

@keep
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; kpd_relation -= 5

我们选择让兴登堡的总统任期继续。

- @agenda_gov: Continue...

@resign
on-arrival: presidency_vacated = 1; pro_republic -= 5; z_relation -= 5; dvp_relation -= 10; presidential_timer = 1 if year < 1933; president = "Bumke" if year >= 1933 and judicial_reform < 4; president = "Großmann" if year >= 1933 and judicial_reform >= 4; presidential_timer = 3 if year >= 1933; president = "N/A" if year < 1933

兴登堡在我们的力量逼迫下辞职。 [? if year >= 1933 : 按照程序,最高法院院长将接替他担任临时总统。 ?]

- @agenda_gov: Continue...

# todo: hindenburg may refuse to resign, allowing the SPD to attempt to impeach him if judicial reform or otherwise referendum against, or just illegally depose him
# todo: successor election if successfully deposed

@government
view-if: not government_decided
on-arrival: government_decided = 1

反动势力虽已被击败,却远未被彻底清除。有人呼吁通过一部「授权法案」把治理权暂时移交给内阁,以便政府迅速行动。

- @enabling: We have no choice but to pass an Enabling Act with a six-month duration.
- @enable_hindenburg: We have no choice but to pass an Enabling Act with a six-month duration.
- @agenda_gov: We will operate entirely by the book in denazification of Germany.

@enabling
view-if: president != "Hindenburg"
on-arrival: pro_republic -= 10; z_relation -= 5; z_relation -= 5 if z_party_leader == "Kaas"; ddp_relation -= 5; dvp_relation -= 10; enabling_act = 1

我们凭借 [+ president +] 的签署与国会三分之二多数的表决通过了授权法案。若愿意,这也使我们得以继续推行更多法令。

- @decrees: We must sign decrees.
- @agenda_gov: That'll be enough.

@enable_hindenburg
view-if: president == "Hindenburg"

兴登堡总统拒绝签署我们的授权法案,要求将其交付公投。我们该怎么办?

- @government: Absolutely nothing, I'm not coding this yet.

@agenda_reb
view-if: spd_rebel = 1
on-arrival: judicial_reform += 4; soviets_exist = 1; soviet_election_time = time+6

反动派的失败给了我们一个独特的机会。我们有多项议题需要处理。 Meanwhile, workers' councils which formed during the general strike have begun to form into workers' councils.

- @presidency: The presidency.
- @chancellorship: The cabinet.
- @constitutional: The constitution.
- @decrees: The country.
- @communists: The KPD.
- @council: The Reichstag.

@presidency
view-if: not presidency_decided
on-arrival: presidency_decided = 1

[? if president == "Hindenburg" : 由于兴登堡是反动派、且曾为希特勒掌权开路,迫使他辞职在党内是个受欢迎的想法。 ?][? if president == "Hitler" : 随着希特勒被击败,总统之位已空缺。通常的程序是举行提前选举,但这里说了算的是我们。 ?]

- @snap_election: We will hold new presidential elections.
#- @braun: We will install Braun as President.
- @provisional: The Reichstag will elect a provisional president to serve until elections can be held.
- @abolish: We will abolish the Presidency entirely.

@snap_election
on-arrival: presidency_vacated = 1; presidential_timer = 2; president = "Bumke" if year >= 1933 and judicial_reform < 4; president = "Großmann" if year >= 1933 and judicial_reform >= 4; president = "N/A" if year < 1933; presidential_timer -= 1 if year < 1933
go-to: agenda_reb

新的总统选举已定于不久后举行。

@braun
on-arrival: president = "Braun"

我们让奥托·布劳恩成为德国总统。

- @agenda_reb: Continue...

@provisional
on-arrival: president = "Wirth"; presidential_timer = 12; presidency_vacated = 1; 

我们把选举交给国会,它选出了中央党的约瑟夫·维尔特作为妥协人选。

- @agenda_reb: Continue...

@abolish
on-arrival: presidency_abolished = 1; presidential_powers = 1; president = "N/A"

我们选择彻底废除总统制,转而建立一个严格的议会制共和国。

- @agenda_reb: Continue...

@chancellorship
view-if: not chancellorship_decided
on-arrival: leverage = spd_votes; chancellorship_decided = 1; spd_in_government = 1; spd_toleration = 0;

我们已通过内战推翻了纳粹内阁,现在必须决定如何填补这些职位、如何分配战后临时政府中的位置。不过,首先我们必须选择与我们共同组建临时政府的政党。

- @kpd_coalition: Naturally, the Communists.
- @weimar_coalition_: Naturally, our Weimar partners.
- @antifa: Perhaps we can build one with both?
- @no_allies: The SPD will govern alone.

@kpd_coalition
view-if: kpd_relation >= 45 and communist_coalition >= 3 and kpd_tried != 1
go-to: chancellor_kpd if kpd_relation >= 60; sway_kpd if kpd_relation < 60

我们可以着手与共产党组建临时政府。他们更有可能赞成那些我们的魏玛盟友会反对的激进变革。

@chancellor_kpd
on-arrival: in_left_front = 1; kpd_relation += 5; z_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 5; dvp_relation -= 10; leverage *= ((rb_strength*rb_militancy)/(rfb_strength*rfb_militancy)); time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

共产党乐于加入我们的临时政府。我们该选谁出任总理?

- @breitscheid_2: Appoint Rudolf Breitscheid.
- @thalmann: Appoint Ernst Thälmann of the Communists.

@sway_kpd
on-arrival: z_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 5; dvp_relation -= 10
on-departure: kpd_tried = 1

共产党要求把总理之位作为参与临时政府的先决条件。我们可以让步,可以另寻盟友,也可以换别的方式满足他们。

- @thalmann: We will concede the Chancellorship to Ernst Thälmann of the Communists.
- @bribe: Smooth things over with our resources, and appoint Rudolf Breitscheid.
- @chancellorship: The Communists are unworkable. We'll find other allies.

@bribe
subtitle: -3 资源.
on-arrival: resources -= 3; unemployed_kpd += 3; workers_kpd += 3; chancellor = "Breitscheid"; chancellor_party = "SPD"; leverage *= ((rb_strength*rb_militancy)/(rfb_strength*rfb_militancy)); time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time
go-to: cabinet_kpd

共产党让步了,同意组成联盟。

@weimar_coalition_
view-if: z_relation >= 40 and ddp_relation >= 20
