Recognizing the DNVP's own participation in the far-right struggle against the Republic, 我们同样取缔了该党,以防其在胡根贝格缺席、无人领导的情况下可能出现的温和转向。

- @decrees_2: Excellent.

@dvp_ban
choose-if: rb_force+rfb_force >= army_force and (left_strength > reformist_strength + center_strength)
